<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chărăcĭas</span></b> ,
			ae, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακίας</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Eit for making poles</i> or <i>stakes</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calamus,</span>”
				<i>a kind of reed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 36, 66, § 168</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A name of a plant</i>, <i>wolf</i>'<i>s-milk</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 26, 8,
				39, § 62</span></i>; called also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chărăcītes</span></b> ,
				ae, m., <i><span class="en">Plin. 26,
				11, 73, § 119</span></i>; <i><span class="en">26, 14, 87, §
			146</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
